# CJK ideographs---the first-100-parts experiment

// this is an experiment to assess the feasibility of building
// Han ideographic font out of a relatively small number of components.
// we've optimized and chosen 100 components that would compose
// 2,970 characters throughout Unicode when laid horizontally.
// (frequency-greedy approach fares worse---only 670 characters.)
// this test serves as both a stress test for build and editor and
// a baseline to build any necessary tool to deal with this volume.

